<title>USA: AlphaNet, USA Technologies in deal.</title>
<headline>AlphaNet, USA Technologies in deal.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlphaNet Telecom Inc's AlphaNet Hospitality Systems Inc said Tuesday it will market a line of business services created by USA Technologies Inc to the hospitality industry.</p>
<p>AlphaNet said the service, called business express, is a credit card activated business center in hotels.</p>
<p>The companies did not disclose financial terms of the deal.</p>
</text>
